Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:03.67,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I am Luiphon Sandhalkia Diltz,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.67,0:00:06.59,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,third prince of this land \Nand captain of the knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.59,0:00:08.72,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,But perhaps most of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:11.86,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I am dear Kyros' friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:14.99,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you, sweet Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:18.14,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,S-So this is the sort of person he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:53.25,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,320)\3c&H6E6C70&\fad(446,429)}Episode 5 "The Prince and the Pitch-Black Warrior"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.29,0:01:55.14,Default Top,Mio,0,0,0,,You took so long to arrive, Prince Luiphon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:57.53,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,so I was just going to leave with Lady Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.53,0:02:01.93,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry, didn't I? You \Ncan be heartless, darling Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:03.85,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please don't call me "darling."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:04.59,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.59,0:02:05.47,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:07.24,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:10.11,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,How does a lavish buffet in \Nthe nobles' salon sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:11.33,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Nobles...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.56,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'm not very hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.85,0:02:19.75,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Oh, Ilza and Hannah aren't \Nhere anymore. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:23.16,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for recommending them without \Nknowing their personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:25.28,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No, it isn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:28.20,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The thought of a place as refined \Nas a salon makes me anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:33.04,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,In that case, what about the \Nswordsmanship exhibition?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.15,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I have reserved seats. Let's go and watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:37.46,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,S-Swordsmanship?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:38.30,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:41.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I, um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:45.88,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, there's no \Nneed to force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:47.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You hate competitions, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.93,0:02:50.04,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,What?! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:52.15,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,This is one of the best aristocratic pastimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:54.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, please, I'd love to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:56.80,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Now that's the reaction I was hoping for!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:59.48,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I can best any knight with a sword, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:03.86,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Kyros once complimented me by saying, "the \Nsword is the only place where you show genius."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:07.65,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Then Lord Kyros truly is strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:09.09,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,He is indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:13.06,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Being complimented by Lord Kyros \Nmade you happy, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:21.25,Default,referee,0,0,0,,We will now begin the semi-finals of the \NDiltz Kingdom Swordsmanship Exhibition!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:26.00,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,This enthusiasm is wonderful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.24,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Last year, I fell asleep during the concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:30.80,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,And dear Kyros kept pinching my cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:34.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Prince Luiphon really loves \NLord Kyros, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:36.57,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm having fun just listening to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:39.66,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Well, it's enjoyable to discuss\N your passions with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:41.74,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:44.70,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm off to procure some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.53,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? But we just ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:48.58,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I wanted to visit all the stalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:50.91,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Your stomach is a separate\N dimension, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.91,0:03:52.33,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Go and eat as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:03.07,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,That fighter in the dark armor \Nis an impressive warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:04.46,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:09.47,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Say, are you like this with Kyros, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:10.52,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:12.74,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:16.01,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Well, you're rather \Ndifferent from the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:18.14,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,And I've known Kyros a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:22.02,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I heard that the two of you were \Nin the same year in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:25.03,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Yes, and the first time we \Nmet we got into a fistfight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:26.11,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:31.80,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,As the duke's son, he was just below me in terms of rank at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:36.38,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,But he said, "Stop judging people based \Non their rank, you moronic prince."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.79,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,M-Moronic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:42.35,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I thought, "What's his problem?" and \Npunched him. Then he punched me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.35,0:04:44.43,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,It turned into quite the commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.59,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Does it really warrant that much laughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:57.07,Default,referee,0,0,0,,Winner, the pitch-black warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:05:00.05,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, is it already over?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.05,0:05:03.27,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Yes. By knocking the point of \Nthe blue knight's sword away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.27,0:05:05.72,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,the dark warrior was able to \Nwin with a single strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.92,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,By the look of things, he was holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:10.53,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,It seems he has the kindness \Nto care for his opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:14.61,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,My sweet Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:18.28,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,doesn't seeing this sort of thing \Nmake you think they're dashing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:21.37,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Many girls squeal with delight, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.37,0:05:23.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:26.84,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I don't find being strong in battle \Nto be particularly wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:30.63,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Aren't strength and reliability the \Nthings that are most attractive in men?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:33.12,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:36.60,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I feel like one day that \Nsword will be pointed at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:40.15,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to \Nmean? You're so negative!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:42.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:48.36,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Say, Lady Marie Shaderan, why \Ndid you become Kyros' fiancée?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:50.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,B-Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:52.63,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I'm my older sister's replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.63,0:05:54.55,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Yes, I am just a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:56.69,Default,referee,0,0,0,,And now, we will begin \Nthe championship bout!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:06:00.33,Default,referee,0,0,0,,The dark warrior versus the green knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:01.83,Default,referee,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:14.43,Default,referee,0,0,0,,Th-The winner... the dark warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.68,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Well, that was an instant defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:22.11,Default,referee,0,0,0,,Congratulations! This is the winner's tro—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:26.61,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,He's putting his worry \Nfor his opponent first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:31.73,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,If he's the one fighting, then perhaps even \NI might enjoy watching his bouts a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:34.19,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,My, that is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:37.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,W-Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:39.12,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,1)\an7\fs16\pos(20,131)\c&H9C83D8&\3c&HDCFDFE&\shad0\b1}Spoils of War
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.53,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I have only just returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:44.57,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You mentioned good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:47.26,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,That dark warrior is the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:50.72,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You seem very certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:55.39,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,His swordsmanship and footwork\N are exactly identical to the master's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:59.70,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros... is the dark warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:03.13,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Shall we see for certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:09.70,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Count Kyros Granado, you're so dashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.78,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Look this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:14.59,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.59,0:07:15.63,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,Count?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:17.84,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,From the Granado Company?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:18.82,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:20.99,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros! Look over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:23.08,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,Take off your helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:38.41,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Every male noble in the Kingdom of Diltz \Nis made to hold the sword at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:42.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The master has trained intensively \Nsince he was a child for self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:44.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,H-He has?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.94,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,That was the best expression\N I've seen today, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:51.36,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Prince Luiphon knew from \Nthe start, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.95,0:08:04.26,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me. What is this line for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:07.70,Default,lady A,0,0,0,,What? It's the line to make an \Nappeal to the count of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:08.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:12.26,Default,lady A,0,0,0,,His fiancée apparently died in an accident. \NThis is a chance to get close to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:19.26,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Of course. No one would think that her \Nincompetent younger sister would replace her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:22.74,Default,lady A,0,0,0,,He may have barbarian blood in him, \Nbut he is the next duke after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:27.26,Default,lady B,0,0,0,,Indeed! And whomever becomes the duke's wife \Ncan certainly stand proudly in society.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:30.73,Default,lady A,0,0,0,,I've heard he's got a difficult \Npersonality, but he's so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:32.81,Default Top,lady B; background,0,0,0,,Isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.32,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Barbarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.02,0:08:35.59,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Difficult?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:38.10,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Who are they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:41.10,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:44.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.64,0:08:45.79,Default,lady A,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:48.26,Default,lady B,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.97,Default,lady B,0,0,0,,Just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.68,Default,lady A,0,0,0,,Indeed! Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:56.09,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I am betroth— I am an \Nassociate of the count's!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:57.40,Default,Lady A; B,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:09:00.76,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, I will hold \Nthem here to the last!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:02.15,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:04.39,Default,ladies,0,0,0,,Get out of my way! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:09.23,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,What was that? They all just \Nsaid whatever they liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:12.01,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,All I did was discover something I liked...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:15.44,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,and he's so kind that he \Nsmiled at me so happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:17.44,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,There's no reason \Nto ridicule him like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.31,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Even if there were...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.51,0:09:24.14,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,it would only be for drawing \Na losing prospect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:27.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.70,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Why did you tell me to enter \Nthe swordsmanship competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:36.31,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You did excellent work! Thanks to \Nyou, it was a rousing success!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.50,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That smile is infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:40.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Was it you who exposed my \Nidentity to the crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:44.73,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,C-Congratulations on your win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:50.32,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I've finally begun hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:51.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:54.13,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are you the real Marie?! In the flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:57.28,Default Top,Kyros,0,0,0,,The one who's like a living miracle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:57.28,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.71,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I invited her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:00.66,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:04.40,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I wanted to show her how \Ndashing you are, Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:08.52,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Though, it seems she wasn't \Nparticularly pleased by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:12.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie doesn't like brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:14.09,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Or aristocratic things either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:17.50,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That's right. And I don't want to \Nforce anyone else's values on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.54,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie's wishes are my only priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:23.15,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Well. You certainly seem quite besotted...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:25.52,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,but she doesn't seem happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.97,0:10:31.56,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,She's simply replacing her older sister \Nin a political marriage, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:37.31,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You'd have gotten engaged no matter what \Nkind of man you faced. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:40.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:44.09,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It's true that when I was first \Ntaken to Granado Castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.43,0:10:46.83,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I didn't even know what \NLord Kyros looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:48.42,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:53.53,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,As I thought, you don't think anything \Nof Kyros, let alone love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:55.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Stop attacking her. What \Nare you so upset about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:59.98,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,When I heard that you were getting \Nengaged, I was overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.98,0:11:05.89,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,My dear, obstinate friend, who had turned away \Nevery noblewoman, had finally found his spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:08.67,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,But in the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.43,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,A political marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:14.94,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,And to a woman who is uneasy with \Nthe customs of the nobility,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:17.39,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,who sees no merit in your efforts, Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:18.58,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,She's her parents' pawn and—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:22.81,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?! Did you \Ninvite Marie here just to disparage her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:25.53,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Not at all. I'm also laughing \Nat your pathetic state.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:29.21,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Coward. The old you would have punched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:30.79,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:33.38,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,And even the old me never \Nthrew the first punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:38.25,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You're just afraid of me. After all, you've \Nnever once beaten me in a sword fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.25,0:11:39.46,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:44.26,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You never noticed that I was \Nletting you have the glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:45.56,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,your highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:04.84,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Earlier, the arena was engulfed in cheers. \NThis time, let's stain it with screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:09.82,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I will make you \Napologize for insulting Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:15.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:19.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please mend things with him! \NWhat Prince Luiphon said is true!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:21.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I can't blame anyone for saying \Nthat I've sold myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:26.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I am foolish and timid, and I've always \Ndone as my parents have told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:29.10,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But more than any of those things...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:33.08,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,it's people ridiculing you because \Nof me that I cannot bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:38.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I... I only \Never cause you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.27,0:12:46.82,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,He only ridicules me out of\Npity for my one-sided love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:52.95,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm sure that he can't stand\N seeing his rival brought so low.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:56.46,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Despite how he seems, he's a passionate man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.41,0:13:02.04,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,But... whatever his reasons, it doesn't \Nmean he's allowed to disparage you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:05.53,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I will face him head on, defeat him, \Nand make him take it all back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:10.27,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you for being angry on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:14.34,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But it's all right. I will \Nregain my honor myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:16.78,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,More importantly for Prince Luiphon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:22.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros, it's the fact that he called \Nyou a coward that I want him to correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:23.65,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I found myself infuriated too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:29.02,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Very well. Then, as one going into battle, \NI ask for you to bestow a good luck kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:29.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:31.49,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Just a jest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:37.76,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,And now, I'll go pummel my \Nbest friend into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.47,0:13:40.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.99,0:13:45.04,Default,referee,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:48.30,Default,referee,0,0,0,,we have the winner of the swordsmanship \Ncontest, Count Kyros Granado,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:51.24,Default,referee,0,0,0,,and the third prince of the Kingdom \Nof Diltz, the captain of the knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:55.18,Default,referee,0,0,0,,his highness, Luiphon Sandhalkia Diltz, \Nin a special exhibition match!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.64,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,You can do this, Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:02.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Luiphon, put on your helmet. \NYou'll get gravely injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:03.92,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,And you, dear Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:07.91,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,If that noble nose of yours gets plucked \Noff, sweet Marie might finally hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.03,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Put your helmet on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:14.75,Default,referee,0,0,0,,Th-Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:17.28,Default,referee,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:30.72,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,It seems your skills haven't declined!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:34.03,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Neither have yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:41.94,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,They seem equally matched \Nin strength, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.57,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.48,0:14:52.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros, don't let him beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:03.32,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,That's an interesting move to make!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:06.60,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? Is that allowed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:07.47,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:28.05,Default,referee,0,0,0,,Winner! Count Kyros Granado!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:31.96,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-You did it! Lord Kyros!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fs26\shad0\fnArial\fad(234,182)\c&H933200&\3c&HFFFFF8&}SILENCE...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.69,Default,child 1,0,0,0,,That fight was amazing! \NI guess fists are good too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:43.34,Default,child 2,0,0,0,,He was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.57,0:15:45.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.43,0:15:49.78,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Come down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:16:00.74,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,D-Did you require something of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.77,0:16:06.82,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Th-This is so high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.82,0:16:08.68,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.68,0:16:09.74,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:14.66,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I will take this moment \Nto make an announcement!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:21.29,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I, Kyros Granado, and Lady Marie Shaderan, \Na baron's daughter, are betrothed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:22.20,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.91,0:16:28.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Together, Lady Marie and I will \Nserve this kingdom to our utmost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:30.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I swear it on the Granado name!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.68,Default,woman,0,0,0,,Betrothed? Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:34.93,Default,man,0,0,0,,Who is Baron Shaderan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:38.53,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:40.97,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:42.94,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.47,0:16:47.14,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Everyone is expecting a beauty \Nthe equal of Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.14,0:16:50.65,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Someone like me will only embarrass him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:52.66,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:02.67,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's all right. You are a far more \Nwonderful woman than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:05.99,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,And no matter what happens, I \Nwill always be by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.41,0:17:07.66,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You are beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:11.47,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,There are so many things \Nthat frighten me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.25,0:17:17.68,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,but if you will be here with me, \Nthen perhaps I can overcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:19.96,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,Nice work! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:21.56,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:25.55,Default,crowd,0,0,0,,Granado! Granado!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:37.04,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:40.30,Default,stall owner,0,0,0,,Oh, you're the one from this afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:43.72,Default,stall owner,0,0,0,,Sorry that I couldn't stop the \Nprince's awful pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:46.33,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Not at all. Please don't worry. \NMore importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:49.39,Default Top,Marie,0,0,0,,I'd love to join the peeling contest this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.39,0:17:51.30,Default Top,stall owner,0,0,0,,You sure are an odd one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:53.07,Default,stall owner,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.07,0:17:55.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you. I can't wait to test my skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:57.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:59.05,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,This seems like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:00.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.13,0:18:01.78,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,May I try this with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:03.26,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.25,0:18:11.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You're very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.72,0:18:14.14,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I have to camp out for work sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:16.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,How is Prince Luiphon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.40,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,In the prime of health.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:24.88,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That's your fault, Luiphon. You do one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:26.38,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,What?! Why do I have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:27.49,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:30.54,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, are there any tricks to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:31.46,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:36.11,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,First, you face the stem downwards, \Nthen you rotate it sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:39.57,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You're really good at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.17,0:18:42.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm quite good at peeling things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:46.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,After all, my life depended on leaving \Nas much of the edible parts as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.01,0:18:50.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You're tougher than you seem. And \NI love that part of you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:51.47,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:54.60,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,The woman doesn't even like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:57.27,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Is it fun being a clown who's \Nracing around, going nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:59.06,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes, it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:03.03,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Just having Marie with me makes \Nevery day seem to sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:09.44,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Even if she doesn't love me, when I think \Nthat tomorrow we may grow a little closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:12.16,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,it's so much fun I can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:20.09,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The day that we become a true married couple \Nmay be years, or decades, in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:24.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,but I'm certain that I will have fun \Nshowering Marie with love until I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:27.40,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:30.87,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,To be frank, that doesn't make you\N the least bit dashing, dear Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:31.97,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:35.10,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you're satisfied...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:37.24,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,then just do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:38.87,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:43.99,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I want to know all about \NLord Kyros' good qualities!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.99,0:19:44.92,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:46.21,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:49.71,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I hope you'll tell me lots \Nof stories again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:53.95,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I understand now, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:58.42,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,You just wanted to talk about your \Nbeloved best friend's best qualities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:00.50,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That's why you invited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:05.83,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.20,0:20:10.76,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,What is this?! \NIt's made for display, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:13.38,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You should've noticed when you touched it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:18.20,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Blast you! I am the third prince and \Ncaptain of our renowned knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:22.19,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,One day I will have you both, husband and \Nwife, dragged off for insulting royalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:28.43,Default Top,Luiphon; background,0,0,0,,I am so angry right now! Don't you \Nunderstand what lèse-majesté is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.48,0:20:28.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Prince Luiphon is amusing, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.19,0:20:30.64,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes. You'd never get tired of him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:39.67,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, I have a message to deliver \Nto the master, so I will be staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:43.41,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,His valet Wolfgang will \Naccompany you in my stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:46.30,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,Pleased to be of service, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:47.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.94,0:20:50.28,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Thank you for today, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:55.94,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No, thank you, Lord Kyros, for letting \Nme see such a dashing side of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:21:01.06,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The truth is, I'd never beaten \NLuiphon in a sword bout before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.43,0:21:05.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros, you are a truly strong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.57,0:21:08.82,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That's because you're with me, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:15.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Whatever you may wish, I will devote all \Nof myself to make that wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:18.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Because everything I am \Nnow is thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:21.14,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'll see you back at the castle, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.61,0:21:22.62,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.30,0:21:37.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.61,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Coachman, please go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:46.65,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie! Wait, just now, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.36,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:52.72,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,In just two months from now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:55.86,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I will marry the person my \Nsister was betrothed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:22:01.78,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It's a political marriage, but one \Nday, like a couple bound by love,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:04.44,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I hope we'll find happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:06.41,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The two of us, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:13.93,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,This does truly appear to be a \Nletter from the House of Shaderan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:16.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes. The handwriting is correct as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.30,0:22:18.34,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.43,0:22:26.29,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are Baron Shaderan and his wife \Nreally Marie's birth parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:24:01.62,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Toppo's cooking is the best in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.62,0:24:03.87,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,And I'll ply my skills again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.73,0:24:09.04,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,My lady is in the midst of working hard \Nin preparation for the wedding ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.49,0:24:13.56,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Let Toppo's sublime sweets \Nsoothe your heart and body!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.73,0:24:15.66,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Next time...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.01,0:24:18.60,Default Top,Toppo,0,0,0,,"Am I Enough As I Am?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:27.01,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,320)\3c&H6E6C70&\fad(438,1)}Episode 6 "Am I Enough As I Am?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.34,0:24:20.76,Default Top,Toppo,0,0,0,,You'd like a second serving?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.76,0:24:22.42,Default Top,Toppo,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure!
